        <source>Clear button in the suffix handle, rendered when IsAllowClear is enabled.</source>
        <target state="translated">後綴 handle 內的清除按鈕，啟用 IsAllowClear 時渲染。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="SemanticContentDescription">
      <segment>
        <source>Selection content panel hosting the placeholder, selection result, search input and tags.</source>
        <target state="translated">選擇內容面板，承載佔位符、選中結果、搜尋輸入與標籤。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="SemanticInputDescription">
      <segment>
        <source>Search input rendered in filter mode.</source>
        <target state="translated">過濾模式下渲染的搜尋輸入框。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="SemanticItemContentDescription">
