    </unit>
    <unit id="SemanticPopupListItemDescription">
      <segment>
        <source>Single tree node entry inside the candidate tree, created at runtime.</source>
        <target state="translated">候選樹中的單個樹節點條目，執行階段建立。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="SemanticPopupRootDescription">
